        "block": "FX:B318",
        "local_block": "delay:B009",
        "pointer": "/blocks/8/text",
        "quote": "The delay signal is preceded by a band-pass filter which can be switched on or off via the Filter toggle. In the display, you can click and drag along the X-axis to adjust the center frequency of the filter, and click and drag along the Y-axis to set the bandwidth. You can also adjust these settings with the Freq and Width sliders."
